mar County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 40 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 on the middle, August to September ran 58% of normal and September to October 50%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 272% of normal on the middle. Grid 13363 had its driest year in 1963 at 61%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 46.6.</p>"}
